  m_Name: L21_GoldenGate
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Cutrium.Presentation::Cutrium.Presentation.Landmark.LandmarkDefinition
  _landmarkId: golden-gate-koprusu
  _displayTitle: Golden Gate Bridge
  _shortDescription: Opened in 1937, the Golden Gate is an immense suspension bridge
    crossing a famously foggy strait. Its International Orange colour makes it visible
    in the mist while harmonising with the surrounding hills. Its 1,280-metre main
    span was a world record when completed, and its Art Deco towers rise about 227
    metres above the water.
  _sector: San Francisco / USA
  _displayTitleTurkish: "Golden Gate K\xF6pr\xFCs\xFC"
  _shortDescriptionTurkish: "1937\u2019de a\xE7\u0131lan Golden Gate, sisli bo\u011Faz\u0131
    ge\xE7en dev bir asma k\xF6pr\xFCd\xFCr. \u201CInternational Orange\u201D rengi,
    k\xF6pr\xFCn\xFCn hem sis i\xE7inde se\xE7ilmesini hem de \xE7evredeki tepelerle
    uyum kurmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flar. 1.280 metrelik ana a\xE7\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131
    tamamland\u0131\u011F\u0131nda d\xFCnya rekoruydu; Art Deco ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131
    kuleleri suyun yakla\u015F\u0131k 227 metre \xFCzerine y\xFCkselir."
  _sectorTurkish: San Francisco / ABD
